              <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders ml-1"></i> طريقة حساب معدل المادة:
            </span>
            <select id="detailedFormula" class="rounded-lg border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-1 font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
